nts","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"One question, otherwise looks great, thanks for such thorough work!","commit_id":"44ad050da93e833ed8c71cf7d00c151435c7b290","state":"approved","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2614#pullrequestreview-2856564162","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2614","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2614#pullrequestreview-2856564162"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2614"}},"submitted_at":"2025-05-21T07:11:03Z","updated_at":"2025-05-21T07:11:03Z","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","event":"reviewed"},{"sha":"e54b3770fa85b3f1a4a32a50f0d04512237480c1","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGU1NGIzNzcwZmE4NWIzZjFhNGEzMmE1MGYwZDA0NTEyMjM3NDgwYzE","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/e54b3770fa85b3f1a4a32a50f0d04512237480c1","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/e54b3770fa85b3f1a4a32a50f0d04512237480c1","author":{"name":"Florian Preinstorfer","email":"site-github@nblock.org","date":"2025-05-16T15:59:57Z"},"committer":{"name":"Florian Preinstorfer","email":"site-github@nblock.org","date":"2025-05-21T12:57:47Z"},"tree":{"sha":"a790f94f30484d6ac7fa2c5e8330c385cd7988d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/a790f94f30484d6ac7fa2c5e8330c385cd7988d4"},"message":"Refactor Debian/Ubuntu package\n\nMove files for packaging outside the docs directory into its own\npackaging directory. Replace the existing postinstall and postremove\nscripts with Debian maintainerscripts to behave more like a typical\nDebian package:\n\n* Start and enable the headscale systemd service by default\n* Does not print informational messages\n* No longer stop and disable the service on updates\n\nThis package also performs migrations for all changes done in previous\npackage versions on upgrade:\n\n* Set login shell to /usr/sbin/nologin\n* Set home directory to /var/lib/headscale\n* Migrate to system UID/GID\n\nThe package is lintian-clean with a few exceptions that are documented\nas excludes and it passes puipars (both tested on Debian 12).\n\nThe following scenarious were tested on Ubuntu 22.04, Ubuntu 24.04,\nDebian 11, Debian 12:\n\n* Install\n* Install same version again\n* Install -> Remove -> Install\n* Install -> Purge -> Install\n* Purge\n* Update from 0.22.0\n* Update from 0.26.0\n\nSee: #2278\nSee: #2133\nFixes: #2311","parents":[{"sha":"d2879b2b3675c6c38b1a39dd7a7b44c1679287a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/d2879b2b3675c6c38b1a39dd7a7b44c1679287a9","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/d2879b2b3675c6c38b1a39dd7a7b44c1679287a9"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"2ce0b900bb15ba720d9a3fe0c9cb4f8ff3579e2d","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDJjZTBiOTAwYmIxNWJhNzIwZDlhM2ZlMGM5Y2I0ZjhmZjM1NzllMmQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/2ce0b900bb15ba720d9a3fe0c9cb4f8ff3579e2d","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/2ce0b900bb15ba720d9a3fe0c9cb4f8ff3579e2d","author":{"name":"Florian Preinstorfer","email":"site-github@nblock.org","date":"2025-05-19T12:30:07Z"},"committer":{"name":"Florian Preinstorfer","email":"site-github@nblock.org","date":"2025-05-21T12:57:47Z"},"tree":{"sha":"6d37551fda6bfb8ecc93cf8fb868f4012308bd42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/6d37551fda6bfb8ecc93cf8fb868f4012308bd42"},"message":"Drop syslog.target and systemd-managed /var/run\n\nThe systemd target \"syslog.target\" and not required because syslog is\nsocket activated.\n\nThe directory /var/run is usually a symlink to /run and its created by\nsystemd via the RuntimeDirectory=headscale option. System creates and\nhandles permissions, no need to manually mark it as a read-write path.","parents":[{"sha":"e54b3770fa85b3f1a4a32a50f0d04512237480c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/e54b3770fa85b3f1a4a32a50f0d04512237480c1","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/e54b3770fa85b3f1a4a32a50f0d04512237480c1"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"5bc5ed5e39972d1f830c40299573bcdd0f5647e7","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDViYzVlZDVlMzk5NzJkMWY4MzBjNDAyOTk1NzNiY2RkMGY1NjQ3ZTc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/5bc5ed5e39972d1f830c40299573bcdd0f5647e7","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/5bc5ed5e39972d1f830c40299573bcdd0f5647e7","author":{"name":"Florian Preinstorfer","email":"site-github@nblock.org","date":"2025-05-21T12:58:17Z"},"committer":{"name":"Florian Preinstorfer","email":"site-github@nblock.org","date":"2025-05-21T12:58:17Z"},"tree":{"sha":"03b7f86ca82f616781eed3bd9b50abe29d7a14e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/03b7f86ca82f616781eed3bd9b50abe29d7a14e6"},"message":"Drop support for Ubuntu 20.04\n\nIts old and our service file logs warning about unsupported options.","parents":[{"sha":"2ce0b900bb15ba720d9a3fe0c9cb4f8ff3579e2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/2ce0b900bb15ba720d9a3fe0c9cb4f8ff3579e2d","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/2ce0b900bb15ba720d9a3fe0c9cb4f8ff3579e2d"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":17753412332,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz8863Nuz6zwAAAAQiL5Ls","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/17753412332","actor":{"login":"nblock","id":131119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTExOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock","html_url":"https://github.com/nblock","followers_u